markedup_text = "Coax it to bite a resin-coated stick."
requirement = SubResource("Resource_ymt2v")
outcome = SubResource("Resource_a8nfe")
markedup_result_text = "The apothecary carefully agitates the spider until it strikes the stick, leaving heavy beads of precious venom behind on the resin.

The apothecary collects it, and successfully produces a cure.

The spider is kept around for future extractions, left mostly to its devices."

